{"name": "Daybreak Torch", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"218\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/bfceac1d255932163fe73ce39a54e68b.poster.avif?t=1787284963\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/bfceac1d255932163fe73ce39a54e68b.webm?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Commander, darkness is drawing closer with every passing moment, and time is running out. To find the Daybreak Torch, we must first overcome the trials set by the gods themselves! Dodge enemy attacks in real time, seize the right moment to unleash your skills, and fight back against overwhelming foes. Only quick reactions and smart tactical decisions can lead your team forward.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Position your heroes and use skills on a 4\u00d74 grid to challenge gods from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/2bff1738a703db4df80cf0bfb935e7c3.poster.avif?t=1787284963\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/2bff1738a703db4df80cf0bfb935e7c3.webm?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/2bff1738a703db4df80cf0bfb935e7c3.mp4?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"218\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/0e5a1345a09012889d62e6a6032d7ed7.poster.avif?t=1787284963\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/0e5a1345a09012889d62e6a6032d7ed7.webm?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the journey continues, heroes from different regions will gradually join your squad. Each of the 6 classes specializes in different combat roles, while every race brings unique skills and new strategic possibilities to the team. Experiment with squad compositions and skill combinations to build your own ultimate hero party!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix races, classes, and skills to create unique warrior squads.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/b56cf7e474afd5714ad2e47d2ad7d1e7.poster.avif?t=1787284963\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/b56cf7e474afd5714ad2e47d2ad7d1e7.webm?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/b56cf7e474afd5714ad2e47d2ad7d1e7.mp4?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"218\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/b0c866d8c5ac38da3f7a184e2da51aee.poster.avif?t=1787284963\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/b0c866d8c5ac38da3f7a184e2da51aee.webm?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once we prove our strength to the gods, we will finally find the Daybreak Torch and enter the Shadow Realm to challenge the Dark Power head-on! The gods will become our allies, granting powerful abilities and blessings to aid us in battle. Choose the blessings that best fit your squad, overcome ever-changing challenges, and march toward the final victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless mode adds more items, mechanics, and buffs for tougher challenges beyond the main stages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/ca750b34acb82c95689a52ff9374e4a9.poster.avif?t=1787284963\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/ca750b34acb82c95689a52ff9374e4a9.webm?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/extras/ca750b34acb82c95689a52ff9374e4a9.mp4?t=1787284963\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "DaybreakTorch is a pixel-art party-based RPG that combines real-time tactical combat with traditional sRPG's squad building. Assemble your own elite hero squad and embark on a heroic, classic adventure set in a mythological world.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133640/ebbd6622ba79ce75c85cf4fde1d38e1fa8e6ee74/header.jpg?t=1787284963", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Party-Based RPG", "Real Time Tactics", "Pixel Graphics", "Fantasy", "Tactical RPG", "Strategy RPG"], "developers": "PikasGameStudio", "publ